      "general": {
        "abstract": "Chiayi Agricultural Experiment Branch was established on 1918.\r\nThere are three research departments in Chiayi Agricultural Experiment Branch, include gardening, agriculture and plant protection.\r\nGardening department researches subtropical fruit trees.\r\nAgriculture department studies the quality rice breeding, diversification breeding and overall rice breed.\r\nPlant protection researches pest prevention and cure of agriculture.\r\n",
